   "mechanisms_outside_ir": [],
   "notes": "This describes OLMo-7B, the headline model. The 1B config differs: it ties weights (\"1B ... yes\" in Table 1), and its d_ff is not stated.\n\nConflicts and choices:\n- d_model for 7B is 4086 in Table 1 but 4096 in the appendix Table tab:llm_arch_adamw. I used 4096; 4086 is likely a typo.\n- Vocabulary: the tokenizer has 50,280 entries, but the embedding matrix is padded to 50,304. 50304 is used for vocab_size.\n- The 1.0E-5 epsilon in the paper is the AdamW epsilon, not the norm eps, so norm_eps is left not_stated.\n\nValues left not_stated:\n- n_kv_heads and head_dim. Attention is \"full\" (not GQA/MQA), which implies kv_heads = 32, but no number is stated.\n- Norm placement (pre vs post). The block_ops order (pre-norm, plus a final norm in the head) is an assumption for buildability; the paper does not state placement or a final norm.\n- RoPE pairing, theta and rotated fraction.\n- MoE: not mentioned; the model is evidently dense.\n\nResidual is marked inherited from the vanilla Transformer via the \"based on\" sentence."
  },
